JVarsoke wrote on 10/14/2003 07:08 AM:
> If I still have the logfile how do I regenerate the record file?

You might try a recmerge utility like

http://home.in.tum.de/~traykovs/nethack/recmerge

and do something like

touch t
grep -v " wizard,\|,quit$" [logfile] > l
./recmerge t l > record

to exclude wizards and perhaps quits (don't remember whether they're
normally included). Not sure how you can exclude eXplores, though. If
you have Jukka's patches (I think logmoves does this), it puts "{exp}"
and "{wiz}" at the end of the lines, so that would be easy.

